---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`About — ${site.shortName}`}
  description="Background, education and certifications."
>
  <h1 class="max-w-prose text-h1">About</h1>

  <div class="prose mt-stack-3">
    <p>
      I work on Dynamics 365 Business Central and NAV at Minsait (Indra Group),
      building APIs and data pipelines that move ERP data into Power BI and
      external systems, and maintaining integrations between BC, SAP and CRM.
      Most of that work is diagnosing why data arrives wrong: timeouts,
      reprocessing, validation. That is what pushed me toward machine learning.
    </p>

    <h2>Experience</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Minsait (Indra Group)</strong> — Business Central Developer /
      Junior ERP Consultant, March 2025 to present. Multi-system integration
      maintenance for purchasing, sales and accounting on the Grupo DomusVi
      account.
    </p>

    <h2>Education</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        BSc Applied Artificial Intelligence — IU International University of
        Applied Sciences, online (Germany). In progress, 2026 to present.
      </li>
      <li>
        Advanced Specialisation Course in Artificial Intelligence and Big
        Data — DigitechFP, Valencia. Post-secondary, EQF Level 5. GPA
        8.67/10. 2025–2026.
      </li>
      <li>
        Advanced Vocational Diploma in Multiplatform Application Development
        (CFGS DAM), EQF Level 5 — IES Abastos, Valencia. 2023–2025.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Certifications</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>AI-103 — in progress</li>
      <li>Microsoft Power BI Data Analyst Associate (PL-300) — in progress</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> ·
      <a href={site.linkedin} rel="me noopener">LinkedIn</a> ·
      <a href={site.github} rel="me noopener">GitHub</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
